WEBVTT

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:01.221
s'kishim qene asnjehere ne ndonje liste.

00:04:01.221 --> 00:04:02.927
Keshtu une mendova se kjo ishte nje gje e mire

00:04:02.927 --> 00:04:05.623
te ishte pjese e listave pozitive qe ata nxirrnin.

00:04:05.623 --> 00:04:07.321
Ishim shume larg kreut te listes,

00:04:07.321 --> 00:04:10.818
por te pakten ishim aty, ishim dikushi.

00:04:10.818 --> 00:04:12.648
Qyteti me i mire per te gjetur pune,

00:04:12.648 --> 00:04:14.663
qyteti me i mire per te nisur nje biznes,

00:04:14.663 --> 00:04:16.456
qendra me e mire...

00:04:16.456 --> 00:04:18.930
Oklahoma City.

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:22.235
Pastaj doli lista

00:04:22.235 --> 00:04:27.781
e qyteteve me obezitetin me larte ne vend.

00:04:27.781 --> 00:04:30.884
Ne ishim aty.